Valid managed-key Rekor v1 intoto/0.0.2 bundle whose canonical log entry
contains payloadHash instead of the full DSSE payload.

Creation: generate ECDSA P-256 artifact-signing and tlog keys; create a DSSE
statement whose SHA-256 subject is `../a.txt`; sign its PAE; and create the
canonical intoto entry with `payloadHash`, `payloadType`, signature, and public
key but no `payload`. The custom log has one leaf, so its root is
`SHA256(0x00 || canonicalizedBody)`; sign that checkpoint with the tlog key and
place its public key in `trusted_root.json`.
